  "description": "纯托管 TDengine ADO.NET 驱动，支持 REST（http://）、WebSocket（ws://）与传统原生 RPC（tcp://）三种连接模式，按 URI scheme 自动识别；零本机依赖，支持 net45~net11。Pure managed ADO.NET driver for TDengine with REST, WebSocket and legacy native RPC transports selected by URI scheme; zero native dependencies, net45~net11.",
